==== Solution

The supplied <double-negation elimination> rule provides the classical step needed to recover each positive component:

|| Line
|| Formula
|| Justification

| 1
| $\neg(\neg\phi\lor\neg\psi)$
| Premise

| 2
| $\neg\phi$
| Assume locally

| 3
| $\neg\phi\lor\neg\psi$
| <Disjunction introduction rule>, left, 2

| 4
| $\bot$
| <Negation elimination rule>, 1 and 3

| 5
| $\neg\neg\phi$
| <Negation introduction rule>, discharging 2–4

